sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Setting write path across QML, bridge, authorization, and D-Bus
    accDescr {
      A user changes a setting in QML. The page calls a bridge invokable which
      validates the value against the registry constraints. If the setting
      requires authorization the polkit gateway consults PolicyKit1; a denial
      is audited and returned as an error while a grant proceeds to the backend
      adapter, which performs the D-Bus call. Success or failure travels back
      as an operation result and backend change events update the exposed
      property so all bound QML views refresh.
    }
    autonumber

    participant Page as QML SettingsPage
    participant Bridge as zettings-bridge<br/>(QObject)
    participant Cap as Capability layer
    participant Polkit as polkit gateway
    participant PK1 as org.freedesktop.PolicyKit1
    participant Adapter as BackendAdapter
    participant Bus as System daemon<br/>(e.g. timedate1)

    Page->>Bridge: setNtpEnabled(true)
    Bridge->>Bridge: spawn op (returns token immediately)
    Bridge->>Cap: evaluate(SettingDefinition.permission)
    alt RequiresAuth
        Cap->>Polkit: authorize(action)
        Polkit->>PK1: CheckAuthorization(subject, action)
        PK1-->>Polkit: AuthenticationRequired
        Note over Page,PK1: KDE polkit agent dialog runs outside Zettings UI
        PK1-->>Polkit: Allowed (after user authenticates)
    else SessionOnly / None
        Cap-->>Bridge: allowed
    end
    Bridge->>Bridge: validate(value, ValueConstraint)
    Bridge->>Adapter: write(Operation)
    Adapter->>Bus: D-Bus method call
    alt success
        Bus-->>Adapter: ack + PropertiesChanged signal
        Adapter-->>Bridge: Ok(())
        Bridge-->>Page: opCompleted(token, Ok)
        Bridge-->>Page: property changed signal (bound views refresh)
        Bridge->>Polkit: audit(entry: actor, action, outcome)
    else failure
        Bus-->>Adapter: D-Bus error
        Adapter-->>Bridge: Err(ZettingsError)
        Bridge-->>Page: opCompleted(token, Err{code, message})
        Bridge->>Polkit: audit(entry: outcome=failed)
    end
